{
    "title": "Hangman Kids",
    "description": "Hangman is a word guessing game, the word to guess is represented by a row of dashes representing each letter of the word. If kid suggests a letter which occurs in the word, the computer writes it in all its correct positions and part of the picture is revealed. If the suggested letter does not occur in the word, the letter is marked as wrong. You have total of 5 chances to guess wrong letter, after which you lose game.\r\n\r\nBy guessing all letters in the word, the complete picture is revealed and kid will be the winner. Based on the wrong attempts, the coins are added to kid's game pocket.\r\n\r\nThis version of the game is designed in such a way that the hangman words are suitable for children's and kids can guess the word by looking at the picture on the screen. Hard word for hangman are introduced as you progress. play hangman and learn the hangman word.\r\n\r\nHere are some of the highlights of the game:\r\n* The game supports English, Chinese \u4e2d\u6587, Spanish Espa\u00f1ola, Indonesian Bahasa Indonesia, Portuguese Portugu\u00eas, French Fran\u00e7ais, Japanese \u65e5\u672c\u8a9e, Russian P\u0443\u0441\u0441\u043a\u0438\u0439, Dutch Deutsch, Hindi \u0939\u093f\u0928\u094d\u0926\u0940 and Kannada \u0c95\u0ca8\u0ccd\u0ca8\u0ca1\r\n* Reveals part of the picture for each correct letter\r\n* 10+ categories and 3000+ words\r\n* Learn by knowing the fact of the things\r\n* hangman online version is coming soon\r\n\r\nThe game is also called as permainan hangman, hangman spel, game hang man, hangman \u0438\u0433\u0440\u0430, snowman, spaceman, Mouse and Cheese Game, Rocket Blast Off, Spider in a Web, Disappearing Snowman and Wordle in the Classroom",
    "descriptionHTML": "Hangman is a word guessing game, the word to guess is represented by a row of dashes representing each letter of the word. If kid suggests a letter which occurs in the word, the computer writes it in all its correct positions and part of the picture is revealed. If the suggested letter does not occur in the word, the letter is marked as wrong. You have total of 5 chances to guess wrong letter, after which you lose game.<br><br>By guessing all letters in the word, the complete picture is revealed and kid will be the winner. Based on the wrong attempts, the coins are added to kid&#39;s game pocket.<br><br>This version of the game is designed in such a way that the hangman words are suitable for children&#39;s and kids can guess the word by looking at the picture on the screen. Hard word for hangman are introduced as you progress. play hangman and learn the hangman word.<br><br>Here are some of the highlights of the game:<br>* The game supports English, Chinese \u4e2d\u6587, Spanish Espa\u00f1ola, Indonesian Bahasa Indonesia, Portuguese Portugu\u00eas, French Fran\u00e7ais, Japanese \u65e5\u672c\u8a9e, Russian P\u0443\u0441\u0441\u043a\u0438\u0439, Dutch Deutsch, Hindi \u0939\u093f\u0928\u094d\u0926\u0940 and Kannada \u0c95\u0ca8\u0ccd\u0ca8\u0ca1<br>* Reveals part of the picture for each correct letter<br>* 10+ categories and 3000+ words<br>* Learn by knowing the fact of the things<br>* hangman online version is coming soon<br><br>The game is also called as permainan hangman, hangman spel, game hang man, hangman \u0438\u0433\u0440\u0430, snowman, spaceman, Mouse and Cheese Game, Rocket Blast Off, Spider in a Web, Disappearing Snowman and Wordle in the Classroom",
